{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "ab64c80a09f049a6dd0e7c6d2946c91fd9883559b030ee38e13dd1c8c144499d", "ja": "#ふたりの共同作業、です♪", "zh": "#两人的共同作业，哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3c854a240385c6a257c06fa2e10678fb9f566c561e176f69ee3c6414c7660ed7", "ja": "なんとか暴走族を振り切った3人。歌織の\n華麗なドラテクにより息も絶え絶えの紬\nだったが、なんともしもの時のためにカー\nチェイス中の動画を撮影していた。歌織は\nこの動画をSNSに投稿してはと提案する。", "zh": "好不容易甩掉暴走族的3人。紬被歌织华丽的驾驶技术折腾得气喘吁吁，却没想到她为了以防万一，竟然拍下了追车过程中的视频。歌织提议把这段视频发布到社交网络上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2cce346dbc2c8f0a82bf6cbdae5397437e6bc54e43987f0362eac338cf615895", "ja": "（歌織さんの運転する車にしがみついているうちに、\n暴走族たちは影も形も見えなくなった……）", "zh": "（在紧紧抱住歌织小姐驾驶的车不放时，暴走族已经消失得无影无踪了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1001_052kao", "source_sha256": "9fa6aa25a520407f949a656a7c121417f164e48f80a48421a4d4f7b4a80634e9", "ja": "しっかり振り切れたみたい……。\nこれで一安心ですね。", "zh": "看来已经彻底甩掉他们了……  \n这下总算可以放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1a7f9878fcea903f5af4ac49ee25bee3c582ec728f3e637c4897cc1010037fec", "ja": "ですね……。何度か高速を乗り降りしていたのは、\nしっかり撒くために……。", "zh": "是啊……之所以几次上下高速公路，是为了彻底甩掉他们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "38b198a29aef4a86656ff636f4eece0ef0aa8353b8ea1bcdb5e42bf7292a5233", "ja": "ええ。今回はあくまで危険を回避するため、\n緊急避難が目的ですから。", "zh": "是的。这次毕竟是为了避开危险，目的在于紧急避难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "67e7502c8c6da84239f336aa0b0cb4dd302d35fa3cfc76823ab47fa0fb3dcb15", "ja": "おふたりを乗せて、そこまで\n無茶な運転をするわけにはいきません。", "zh": "载着两位，不能开得那么莽撞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3b679de5460c4ee6119be8569da22b24c46045711476e1e3598c4a4b6f1afec3", "ja": "（あれで無茶をしていない運転だったのか……）", "zh": "（那种程度居然还不算乱来吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bc16c2cc44b0b10176bb7a61c423aad954209e7e7aac708c17c6829a2f11ff96", "ja": "ふぅ……ようやく頭がクラクラしなくなってきました。\nえらい目におうた……。", "zh": "呼……头终于不再晕乎乎的了。\n真是遭了大罪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "9e93d8b83c6edcd3817d0f1018603eb2b6d20fe96d31e7fabbb79b69e818b9bb", "ja": "紬ちゃんも、お疲れさま！\nナビをしてくれて本当に助かったわ。", "zh": "紬，你也辛苦了！\n真的多亏你帮忙导航。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "25b8db537426332fd9b40e582f0a00dd183e8b9acf982220041ae3f9d48d0023", "ja": "い、いえ……。\n……。", "zh": "不、不用了……。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "2bbe7e9655982811f8f5f26e300e6d6f61943976a18590e7b306e0fd0962253b", "ja": "？　どうしたの？\nもしかして、車酔いとか……。", "zh": "？怎么了？该不会是晕车了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4fbcbdc042c7f1af0c1e8560c3c311862c5c4dad9cbe4061b93ffef67c6ce123", "ja": "違うんです！\nそうではなく……。", "zh": "不是这样的！\n不是那回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ca478ff40f50aecfb41a2259ec0ef926a888d8084106462f76f718c9b0871ff5", "ja": "桜守さんは運転がお得意と聞いていましたが……\nまさか、あれほどとは思わず……。", "zh": "听说樱守小姐很擅长开车……\n没想到竟然那么厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "6844c2359be92011c54a538922e18d337bf9c17897927e14a34a1d768a55d92d", "ja": "ふふっ、それほどでも♪　紬ちゃんも大はしゃぎで\n楽しんでくれてたみたいで、よかったわ。", "zh": "呵呵，也没那么夸张啦♪看到小紬也玩得那么开心，看来她很享受，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b504dcf208ffb10a38fb59236e358217bc0fb88fd6b87a2fe61c18254fbee941", "ja": "た、楽しんでいたわけではありません！\nあのような思いは、もう……！", "zh": "并、并不是在享受！\n那种经历，我再也不想……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "b7a5b894829fa6c83e443706bbff052ea961b58f20d9fbab1a98a7f2226a6630", "ja": "そう？　せっかくだから、これから金沢の\n夜景巡りを……なんて考えていたんだけれど。", "zh": "是吗？难得来到这里，我本来还想着接下来去逛逛金泽的夜景……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b4158bf92ee4a18394675a2ee8a12dc326d3e3e6aebb9ff0f029b61ed53b8e3c", "ja": "金沢の夜景……。\nそういえば、さっき紬も同じ事を言ってたな。", "zh": "金泽的夜景……说起来，刚才紬也说了一样的话啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9677fbcf189a5c03e5be9e0ff04962bf239c5fb28c2a71143e050d24ab6f07f2", "ja": "{$P$}、\n余計なことは言わなくていいのです。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n不用说多余的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f01d48a6eec2e76c548f8b7bcdf9d651e29490eab6887f1bc1a2230014e8ae66", "ja": "あの豪快で奔放な運転、思い出すだけで……\nうう、動画もあまり見返す気になれませんね……。", "zh": "一想起那种豪迈又随性的驾驶方式……呜，我也不太想再回看视频了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "774e24058897f09f48ce4644401e21da5794ecef5ead16511b1af2ba25981a6b", "ja": "動画？", "zh": "视频？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e185e3f69abb6620f678accd873e638fe26d2c9f8445a52486998997f00714f8", "ja": "ええ。桜守さんが運転しているところを、\n撮っていました。私のスマートフォンで……。", "zh": "是的。我用自己的手机……拍下了樱守小姐开车的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "9ba75898944544501804a499b98819788ec0ef574472c8934c10256dcfb71db8", "ja": "え！　紬ちゃん、あの運転の中で\n動画撮影をしていたの？", "zh": "诶！紬，你居然在那种驾驶过程中拍视频吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c6c8987728339fe7f087b6a18f7efa3af33cd1a261470321ed29a2c2303d047b", "ja": "はい。なにせ、相手は暴走族の方々。\nもしもの時のために、証拠があったほうが良いかと。", "zh": "是的。毕竟对方可是飙车族。\n为了以防万一，我想还是留有证据比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "5b372738ca4d8c65a7c634e2364f57dd5010b073022b867d0bfcb547dd305fc8", "ja": "そう、撮影していたの……。\n……。", "zh": "是的，我一直在拍摄……。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "e63ce536ca538f343f4c4735393c3387581139bea61d7415fddd28084271453b", "ja": "その動画……\n編集してSNSに投稿するのって、アリかしら……？", "zh": "那段视频……\n剪辑后发到社交平台上，你觉得可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fdba88df6455a21bd4cb093c9dce11cbe31f0cd33acbf446c7ff48b47fb7b984", "ja": "！？　……桜守さん、\nあなたには怖いものがないのですか……？", "zh": "！？……樱守小姐，您就没有害怕的东西吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1025_052kao", "source_sha256": "e3a01e842ad1339bdbcd766f4aa1de231e58ec1163bc8e261be0005b2e9f39b6", "ja": "もちろん、そのまま投稿したらよくないでしょうけど。\n編集すれば、なんとか……。", "zh": "当然，直接投稿出去肯定不行吧。\n不过，编辑一下的话，应该还是有办法的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "39535390625c4f6f2726ce6defe27bf5b5f36fba0c6e52e446633d3b369c14c6", "ja": "ならないと思います。\n私はこの動画を投稿するのは反対です。", "zh": "我觉得不行。\n我反对发布这段视频。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d83aa5ecc4542a4e691dcb7e3046b04adbd01fa8721ed8ba44a4bb2834fe8ddc", "ja": "暴走族の方とか、他にも色々映っているはずで……\nそうでしょう、{$P$}！", "zh": "里面应该还拍到了飙车族的人，还有其他各种各样的……\n对吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1028_p", "source_sha256": "11062bea44ac6d072b0b549815f11550bf5f3893c11c4cd3d4dc5d9927050f1e", "ja": "ま、まあ普通に考えたらそうだな。\nでも多分、ちゃんと撮れてるのは一部じゃないかな？", "zh": "嗯、仔细想想确实是这样。\n不过，能好好拍下来的应该只是一部分吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1029_051tmg", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "fddfc17618670897678c61d961b990640564d9da007c544c51e1e6b9e5ac12e0", "ja": "あの運転の中での動画撮影だろう？\nまともな映像が撮れてると、期待しない方が……。", "zh": "那可是那种开车状况下拍的视频吧？\n最好还是别指望能拍出什么像样的画面了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6d8139ebef28fa59e3052a7200f2cddfd76f927b13b0577415dbc32e4b785f81", "ja": "……。\nか、確認してみます。", "zh": "……。\n我、我这就确认一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cc4ce4f34e5f4e018c5501684d64d6a77cbd17851bc6e8605683681e2a608392", "ja": "『そ、そこっ、右です！\n曲がれば、高速に乗れるげん……っ！』", "zh": "『那、那里，右转！\n转过去就能上高速了……！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1033_052kao", "source_sha256": "3027565a730bb4db53dac2a2fdc70758023d239aa358a78d7757c1019cce0d81", "ja": "『了解！　さあ、ここからが本番……\n舌を嚙まないように気をつけて、ねっ！』", "zh": "明白！来吧，接下来才是真正的开始……\n小心别咬到舌头哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_05_1034_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f8f2c9fa1fd5f8762e3f90e02484fde43c6f4fb7198e35e93a7a18852df390b0", "ja": "『きゃあああああああっ！？　うぐっ！\nく、車を縦に、縦に揺らさんといて～っ！？』", "zh": "『啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！？呃！\n别、别让车上下、上下摇啊——！？』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
